  id: last-light
  title: Last Light
  description: The contracts connect at a single surveillance hub. Take control of the hub, then erase the targeting index in the vault. Give the city one quiet night.
  company: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 691c6d9369c0cc641b0565a55fc6beec, type: 2}
  network: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 91e48806285ad734ca698b8c5a18124a, type: 2}
  client: NULL // everyone is listening
  tag: INFRASTRUCTURE DISRUPTION
  objective: Control Security hub, then erase the index at Research vault.
  condition: 'Below 70% trace: +100 cr / +20 XP. Each optional archive: +100 cr / +15 XP; all three pay XP.'
  aftermath: The surveillance grid goes dark. Lark opens the research, June publishes the records, and Null keeps the channels alive. You built more than a career. The planet is a little harder to own.
  displayKind: 3
  recurring: 0
  requiredWins: 5
  quietLimit: 70
